        "officialHost": "code.claude.com",
        "sections": ["CLAUDE.md load locations"],
        "reviewedOn": "2026-08-18",
        "establishes": "The load-location table lists the project root, parent-directory, subdirectory, and local rows separately, and each is gated on a settingSources value — a runtime input this tool never observes, which is why one rule admits every depth and classifies none of them."
      }
    ]
